WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.010
You want to go above zone two.

2
00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:04.760
So I would guess where that idea comes from

3
00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:06.300
is again, coming back

4
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.060
to those elite endurance athletes,

5
00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:10.020
they're doing massive volumes of training.

6
00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:11.680
They're doing really high volumes

7
00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:13.230
of high intensity training

8
00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:16.030
and they need to have recovery days.

9
00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.200
They need to have days

10
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.090
where they're not stressing their system,

11
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:20.770
not accumulating metabolic stress.

12
00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:22.750
And so in those athletes,

13
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.560
they want to stay below zone,

14
00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:27.810
or in zone two, below zone three.

15
00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:29.890
So they're not depleting glycogen,

16
00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:30.900
not accumulating fatigue

17
00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:32.090
so they can recover.

18
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:34.690
And I think if your aim is recovery,

19
00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:37.220
if you slip up into that zone three

20
00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:38.820
and you start depleting glycogen,

21
00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:39.370
accumulating fatigue,

22
00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:41.350
now you're not recovering anymore.

23
00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:43.520
So in that setting, it makes sense to me

24
00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:45.220
that you need to stay in zone two

25
00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:47.790
because you're trying to avoid stress.

26
00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:49.700
But for most of us

27
00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:51.980
who are doing physical activity,

28
00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:54.610
guideline levels of exercise,

29
00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:56.290
we probably don't need to worry about that.

30
00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:58.320
And I think we should actually be thinking

31
00:00:58.320 --> 00:00:59.340
about the opposite way

32
00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:01.020
as we want to get above zone two

33
00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:01.970
as much as we can.
